# Every report (Manage > Reports) on the Timesaver example, plus one straight on
# a second layer, two straights that meet at an angle and a JSON note: Refresh,
# Save to a file, select the first row (which pans to it), and for Track Lengths
# a layer filter that leaves only the second layer.
# Until now the demos only opened each report and cancelled it. The saved
# reports are compared with app/bin/unittest/testfiles/reports-expected/ by
# tools/check-reports-test.sh, which leaves out the date line.
